[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Week qualification orchestration

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: WQ-001
TITLE: Immutable daily source execution
STATEMENT: >>>
The runner shall pin each child to an exact source revision, refresh only between chunks, gate a new daily checkout before activation, and retain/report the last valid revision when refresh fails.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: WQ-002
TITLE: Honest outcomes and deadline recovery
STATEMENT: >>>
The runner shall retain inconclusive and interrupted work, fail on counterexamples or invalid contracts, checkpoint the original deadline and next seed, and never label daily Running reports as final Passed.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: WQ-003
TITLE: Results-only verified submission
STATEMENT: >>>
The runner shall commit only bounded results on a unique qualification branch, verify remote commit and content hashes, and retain failed or unsubmitted uploads for retry. Numerical counters shall not be combined across source revisions.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: WQ-004
TITLE: Owned post-submission cleanup
STATEMENT: >>>
Unless KeepResults is selected, cleanup shall remove only run-owned files included byte-for-byte in a verified submission. Cleanup shall reject outside, foreign, changed, directory and reparse paths and shall preserve unsubmitted bulk logs and source checkouts.
<<<
